      "tabPt": 18
     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Dalfampridine ER (Ampyra) interactions and OD:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " OCT2 inhibitors (ex, cimetidine) may ↑ dalfampridine exposure; ↑levels ↑ sz risk; weigh benefit of concurrent OCT2 inhibitors vs sz risk. OD: sz, confusion, tremulousness, diaphoresis, amnesia; some develop status epilepticus responsive to strd sz therapy."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
